<section class="legal">
  <h2>Your files stay on your device</h2>
  <p>Images, subtitles and other files you open in a tool are read and processed by your browser. They are never uploaded to a ReelFlow server. Tools that fetch a YouTube thumbnail request it directly from YouTube's public image servers.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>The site stores your cookie choice in your browser's local storage so the notice does not appear on every visit. No advertising or analytics scripts run until you accept them.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>If you accept the cookie notice, the site may load advertising scripts from a third-party ad network to keep the tools free. Those networks may set their own cookies under their own policies. If you decline, no advertising scripts are loaded.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions about this site, contact the site owner through the YouTube channel linked from the footer once social links are added.</p>
</section>
